sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as UI + TanStack DB
  participant API as tRPC (server)
  participant PG as Postgres
  participant E as Electric

  UI->>UI: Optimistic update
  Note right of UI: No spinner
  UI->>API: mutate()
  API->>PG: INSERT/UPDATE in a transaction
  API-->>UI: { txid }
  PG-->>E: Logical replication
  E-->>UI: Change arrives on the shape stream
  UI->>UI: txid matched
  Note right of UI: Optimistic state replaced<br/>by synced data
  Note over UI,API: On failure, the optimistic change rolls back
